```

---

## 7. Adding New Tests

1. Add the capability to `specs/<domain>.md` — status ❌
2. Add the row to `COVERAGE.md`
3. Write the scenario with two tags: `domain` + `feature-slug`
4. Add support keywords in `resources/pages/<domain>_page.<ext>`
5. Flip spec row and COVERAGE.md row to ✅ after the test passes
6. Validate with dry-run before committing

---

## 8. Coverage Sync (mandatory after every task that creates or automates a case)

After every task: update `COVERAGE.md`, update `specs/<domain>.md`, sync {{ doc_label }}.
A task is not done until all three agree.

See `.claude/rules/coverage-sync.md` for the full procedure.
